<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Go, RATTATA!\rTackle!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What? This is a big battle!\fLeave me alone!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A Pokémon can use its moves as long\nas the moves still have PP.\rWhen a move has no PP remaining, that\nPokémon cannot use that move.\rThen you should take your Pokémon to\nthe Pokémon Center.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A Pokémon can use its moves as long\nas the moves still have PP.\rWhen a move has no PP remaining, that\nPokémon cannot use that move.\rThen you should take your Pokémon to\nthe Pokémon Center.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m not a Trainer.\rBut if you look one in the eyes,\nprepare to battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hey, kiddo!\rHow in the world can you be so\noblivious to my eye-catching house?\fHold it right there!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Apricorns! Pick ‘em, dry ‘em, and\nold Kurt down in Azalea turns ‘em\finto Balls you can’t buy in any\nshop.\rHere--take a Box to carry them.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">With that Apricorn Box, you can\ncarry so many Apricorns.\rWhen you reach Azalea, tell Kurt\nthat Wesley still sends his best.\fHe’ll know.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rt. 30\nSouth to Cherrygrove City</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mr. Pokémon’s House\nStraight Ahead!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mr. Pokémon’s House</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Trainer Tips\rNo stealing other people’s Pokémon!\rPoké Balls are to be thrown only at\nwild Pokémon!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! You’re wearing the Running Shoes.\rThey make you feel like you are flying,\ndon’t they?\rBut beware of wild Pokémon and\nTrainers!\rWhen you run, the noise will\nattract them.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: There you are! I was\nstarting to think Gold’s shoes\fwere decorative.\rOkay. Real talk. Cherrygrove was\nthe tutorial. THIS is the game.\fWild Pokémon that don’t care about\nus, Trainers who absolutely do,\fand an Apricorn guy who’ll talk\nyour ear off if you let him.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Rule one of being Trainers:\nif a sign says Trainer Tips, we\fpretend we read it.\rRule two: Mr. Pokémon’s place is up\nnorth and he gives stuff away.\fWe are DEFINITELY visiting\nMr. Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Race you to the first\nTrainer, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rLoser carries the conversation!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: There you are, slowpoke!\rLook at this place - real tall grass,\nreal wild Pokémon, just waiting.\rI’ve been creeping around trying not\nto spook ’em -\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: ...Wait. Wait wait wait.\nTHERE’S one!\rCome on, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} - let’s\nget him!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: Whoa - HOLD it, you two! You\ndon’t go charging a wild Pokémon\nwith none of your own.\r...And now it’s spotted you. Of\ncourse it has.\fStand back, both of you.\rLet me show you how this is done.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: ...And - gotcha.\rHeh. Still got the touch.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: Phew. That was close.\rYou kids can’t go running off into\ntall grass like that!\rWhat to do with you two... *sigh*\fAlright. Come with me.\rGuess it’s my job to show you the\nropes, now that the old man’s gone.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gold</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0375_R30_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOLD: Here--take these. Five Poké\nBalls, on me.\rYou saw how it’s done. When it’s your\nturn out there, you’ll be ready.\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
